 python3-gpiod
Description: GPIO server service for pympacds
 pympacds-gpio monitors GPIO line state and edge events and exposes reads,
 writes, and change notifications over D-Bus.
 .
 It uses the gpiod (libgpiod v2) Python bindings behind an internal shim and
 exports the GPIO contract (get_value/set_value/get_lines/status with the
 line_changed signal) alongside the framework Health and Config contracts.
 .
 A udev rule grants the gpio group access to /dev/gpiochip* so the service
 does not need to run as root.
